 didn't check, so I removed that claim.\n\n**Carriers:** The profile names `dca-modelling` for this stage, but I didn't use it because no domain type changes. I applied `dca-discipline` to the one file I wrote; it's a view in the web host, so none of its layer rules apply. I didn't consult `dca-knowledge` because the change raises no pattern question.\n\nI ran no other stage and committed nothing. The uncommitted edits to `BasePage.cs` and `HomePage.cs` belong to other stories, and I left them untouched.","ttft_ms":3367,"type":"result","duration_ms":141011,"uuid":"0225edd8-9355-41c4-b9b5-2f876e856f6d","ttft_stream_ms":2060,"time_to_request_ms":32,"first_content_frame_ms":2060,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
